<h1>Supplier shutdown plan</h1><p>Private planning updates do not order goods, change stock or send supplier email. Each purchase draft requires your exact source review. Its later approval and delivery use the ordinary purchasing controls.</p>
<% if(problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem %></p><% } %><% if(shadow){ %><p class="notice">The first 14 days are Watch only. Saving plans, routine authority and purchase preparation are paused.</p><% } %>
<% if(latest){ const facts=latest.source_snapshot; %><section class="card"><h2>Latest saved private plan</h2><p>Prepared <%= helpers.dateTime(latest.created_at) %> · <%= latest.automatic?'Within the owner’s private planning scope':'Individually reviewed' %>.</p><%- include('supplier-shutdown-body',{facts}) %>
<% if(latest.purchase_order_id){ %><p><a class="btn" href="/purchasing/orders/<%= latest.purchase_order_id %>">Open the prepared purchase order</a></p><% }else if(['pro','enterprise'].includes(plan)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/shutdown-plans/<%= latest.id %>/purchase" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceFingerprint" value="<%= latest.source_fingerprint %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed these exact product quantities, current stock and supplier terms and approve preparing one purchase draft. This does not approve or send it.</label><button class="btn" <%= shadow||!fresh||fresh.sourceFingerprint!==latest.source_fingerprint||facts.warnings.length||!facts.calculated.rows.some(r=>r.quantityUnits>0)?'disabled':'' %>>Prepare reviewed shutdown purchase draft</button></form><% }else{ %><p><span class="badge">Pro</span> Preparing a purchase from this plan requires Pro.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a><% } %></section><% } %>
<% if(fresh&&['pro','enterprise'].includes(plan)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><% for(const key of ['supplierId','locationId','reference','lastOrderDate','closedFrom','closedThrough','nextArrivalDate','extraCoverDays']){ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= fresh.scope[key] %>"><% } %><input type="hidden" name="skuIds" value="<%= fresh.scope.skuIds.join(',') %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceFingerprint" value="<%= fresh.sourceFingerprint %>"><details><summary>Review the current stock basis before saving an update</summary><%- include('supplier-shutdown-body',{facts:fresh}) %></details><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed the current exact private plan and its source warnings.</label><button class="btn" <%= shadow?'disabled':'' %>>Save reviewed plan update</button></form><% } %>
<section class="card"><h2>Keep this private plan current</h2><% if(['pro','enterprise'].includes(plan)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns/<%= project.id %>/settings" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= project.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceFingerprint" value="<%= fresh?.sourceFingerprint||'' %>"><label class="rm-field"><span>Days between updates</span><input name="refreshDays" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="<%= project.refresh_days||'' %>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I authorize private plan updates only for this supplier, warehouse, checked dates and products. Changing purchase terms needs another review. This grants no authority to approve, send or pay a purchase order.</label><button class="btn" <%= shadow||!fresh?'disabled':'' %>>Enable private shutdown planning</button></form><% }else{ %><p><span class="badge">Pro</span> Private plan updates require Pro. Growth can review suggestions.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a><% } %>
<% if(project.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns/<%= project.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= project.revision %>"><button class="btn" name="stop" value="yes">Stop shutdown plan updates</button></form><% } %></section><p>If the supplier corrects its notice, stop the superseded scope and record the corrected notice. AI credits used: 0.</p>
